---

ViKi AI modifications and extensions:
- Holographic interface (Three.js/WebGL orb component)
- Voice I/O integration (STT/TTS with local and cloud backends)
- ViKiModelProvider abstraction layer
- Model routing with capability-based selection
- Circuit breaker fallback mechanism
- Cloud provider adapters (Gemini, Groq, OpenRouter)
- Rebranding from OpenJarvis to ViKi
- Configuration directory: ~/.viki (was ~/.openjarvis)
- CLI entry point: viki (was jarvis)
- Tauri desktop app: com.viki.desktop (was com.openjarvis.desktop)

